        </div>

        <div class="case-studies-grid">
          <div class="flexy case-study-card">
            <div class="case-study-image">
              <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="Retail Sales Transformation">
            </div>
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4>Retail Sales Transformation</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <p>Implemented an integrated CRM solution that increased sales conversion by 42% for a national retail
