            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">
                Read Case Study
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flexy case-study-card">
            <div class="case-study-image">
              <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="B2B Sales Pipeline Optimisation">
            </div>
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4>B2B Sales Pipeline Optimisation</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <p>Developed a custom CRM workflow that shortened sales cycles by 35% and improved forecast accuracy.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">
                Read Case Study
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flexy case-study-card">
            <div class="case-study-image">
              <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="Customer Retention Strategy">
            </div>
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4>Customer retention strategy</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <p>Created a data-driven retention program that reduced churn by 28% for a subscription-based service.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">
                Read Case Study
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="view-all-container">
          <a href="#" class="view-all-btn">View All Sales and CRM Case Studies</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-content" id="safety">
        <div class="category-header">
          <div class="category-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-hard-hat"></i>
