          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="view-all-container">
          <a href="#" class="view-all-btn">View All Safety Case Studies</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-content" id="automated-processes">
        <div class="category-header">
          <div class="category-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-cogs"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="section-title">Automated processes</h3>
          <p>Streamlining operations through intelligent automation solutions&period;</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flexy case-studies-grid">
          <div class="flexy case-study-card">
            <div class="case-study-image">
              <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="Financial Services Automation">
            </div>
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4>Financial Services Automation</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <p>Automated core banking processes resulted in a 65% reduction in processing time and 89% fewer
