            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">
                Read Case Study
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flexy case-study-card">
            <div class="case-study-image">
              <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="Manufacturing Production Automation">
            </div>
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4>Manufacturing Production Automation</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <p>Implemented end-to-end production automation that increased output by 52% while reducing labor costs.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a href="#" class="read-more-btn">
