            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flexy case-study-card">
            <div class="case-study-image">
              <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="Logistics Process Transformation">
            </div>
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4>Logistics Process Transformation</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <p>Developed automated logistics systems that improved delivery times by 40% and reduced operational costs
